cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in academic work, please cite it."
type: software
title: "MSX1 on Tang Nano 20K"
abstract: >
  A complete MSX1 computer implementation in Verilog for the Tang Nano 20K
  FPGA board (Gowin GW2AR-18C). Includes a complete Z80 CPU, TMS9918A VDP,
  AY-3-8910 PSG, Intel 8255 PPI, HDMI output, PS/2 keyboard, and SD card
  controller.
license: MIT
keywords:
  - fpga
  - msx
  - z80
  - verilog
  - retro-computing
  - tang-nano
  - gowin
  - hdmi
  - tms9918a
  - ay8910
repository-code: "https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/msx1-tang-nano-20k"
